termshot
--------

`internal/termshot/output.go` is vendored from homeport/termshot
(https://github.com/homeport/termshot), release v0.6.1, file
`internal/img/output.go`. The package declaration was changed from `img`
to `termshot` to suit the vendoring path; the code is otherwise unmodified.

