time (tracked in `go.mod`). These are not vendored; they are fetched by
`go mod` like any other dependency, but their licenses are reproduced in
distributed binaries by Go's module system.

- github.com/fogleman/gg                 (MIT)
- github.com/golang/freetype             (FTL or GPLv2 — this project
                                          distributes under FTL)
- github.com/esimov/stackblur-go         (MIT)
- github.com/gonvenience/bunt            (MIT)
- github.com/gonvenience/font            (MIT)
  - bundles the Hack monospace typeface   (Hack Open Font License v2.0,
                                           which is MIT-style with a name
                                           reservation — see
                                           https://github.com/source-foundry/Hack)
- github.com/gonvenience/term            (MIT)
- github.com/mattn/go-isatty             (MIT)
